---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import LegalPage from "../../components/sections/Legal/LegalPage.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/sections/Footer/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — Kersivo"
  description="The terms that govern use of the Kersivo website and any project enquiries or engagements with our studio."
>
  <LegalPage
    title="Terms of Service"
    lead="Please read these terms before using this website or making an enquiry. They're short and straightforward."
    updated="March 2026"
  >

    <h2>Agreement</h2>
    <p>
      By accessing or using the Kersivo website (kersivo.co.uk), you agree to these terms of service.
      If you do not agree, please do not use this website.
    </p>
    <p>
      Kersivo is a trading name of a UK-based web design studio. References to "we", "us", or "Kersivo"
      throughout this document refer to the same entity.
    </p>

    <h2>Use of this website</h2>
    <p>
      You may use this website for lawful purposes only. You must not attempt to interfere with the
      website's operation, introduce malicious code, or access areas not intended for public use.
    </p>
    <p>
      All content on this website — including text, design, images, and code — is the intellectual
      property of Kersivo and may not be reproduced without prior written permission.
    </p>

    <h2>Enquiries and project engagements</h2>
    <p>
      Submitting an enquiry form does not create a contract or obligation on either party. A formal
      engagement begins only when a written proposal or statement of work has been agreed and confirmed
      in writing by both parties.
    </p>
    <p>
      Any details shared during initial discussions are treated as confidential and will not be disclosed
      to third parties. We expect the same respect in return.
    </p>

    <h2>Pricing and payment</h2>
    <p>
      Prices displayed on this website are indicative. Final pricing is confirmed in a written proposal
      specific to your project. We reserve the right to update pricing at any time; changes will not
      affect engagements already confirmed in writing.
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      This website is provided in good faith and on an "as is" basis. We make no guarantees regarding
      uninterrupted availability or the absence of errors.
    </p>
    <p>
      To the fullest extent permitted by UK law, Kersivo is not liable for any direct, indirect, or
      consequential loss arising from use of this website or reliance on its content. Nothing in these
      terms limits liability for fraud or death or personal injury caused by negligence.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party links</h2>
    <p>
      This website may include links to third-party websites. These are provided for convenience only.
      We have no control over their content and accept no responsibility for any third-party site.
    </p>

    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p>
      These terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales. Any disputes will be subject to the
      exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of England and Wales.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>
      We may update these terms from time to time. The date at the top of this page reflects the most
      recent revision. Continued use of the website after any update constitutes acceptance of the
      revised terms.
    </p>

    <div class="k-legal__contact">
      <div class="k-legal__contact-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
          <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/>
          <path d="M3 7l9 7 9-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="k-legal__contact-body">
        <span class="k-legal__contact-label">Have a question about these terms?</span>
        <p class="k-legal__contact-text">
          Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@kersivo.co.uk">hello@kersivo.co.uk</a> —
          we reply within 12 hours on business days.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </LegalPage>

  <Footer showTopCta={false} />
</BaseLayout>
